":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T18:37:52-08:00","id":311836,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/303245-looking-for-game-blood-and-smoke?p=311178#post311178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have never done a play by post on a forums. I think it would be hard to play here because it times you out (or it does me anyway) if you take too long to type something or don't use it for a while. It also doesnt notify you when you get a message. Though I suppose it would be great for people who just want to plop something in every couple of days or whatever. I would really prefer something in real time. Thedonnie and I have been chatting about getting some Vampire game going, he wants to ST. I would prefer something in real time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would prefer something real-time, too. Harder to organise, but more satisfying. I'd go for whatever works best.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date